#, fuzzy
msgid "This extension provides imperative and reactive APIs and low-level and high-level (type-safe) clients."
msgstr "该扩展提供了命令式和响应式 API，以及低级和高级（类型安全）客户端。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Use the Redis Client"
msgstr "使用 Redis 客户端"

